 economic option.<br\/><br\/><strong>Skill Level<\/strong>: Beginner Athletes<br\/><br\/><em>Starting at $4.99\/sq ft.<\/em><\/p>","button_label":"BUY FOLDING GYM MATS","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/folding-gymnastics-mat","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"5746e60d-0837-4680-b423-9347ad785914":{"type":"promo-grid","blocks":{"7cb67bd8-1683-48f3-a6b5-aee1488b32a5":{"type":"banner","settings":{"heading":"Custom markings and game lines available via special order.","text":"Contact Us Today!","link":"shopify:\/\/pages\/contact-us","label":"","color_tint":"#000000","color_tint_opacity":8,"framed":true}}},"block_order":["7cb67bd8-1683-48f3-a6b5-aee1488b32a5"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":true,"gutter_size":20,"space_above":false,"space_below":false}},"cbd2b620-c585-48c5-b780-32ae8804035d":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MaincoverBasketballcourt_1.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Basketball Flooring Kits","text":"<p>Our Outdoor Basketball Flooring Kits are pre-assembled kits and come with markings and edging for convenience. These top-selling multi-sport outdoor court flooring are certified easy to install, slip resistance, and shock-absorbent.<\/p>","button_label":"Buy Basketball Flooring Kits","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/outdoor-basketball-flooring-kits","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_JQFGGz":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Dunk_Pro_Outdoor_Basketball_Hoop_Lifestyle4.jpg","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Dunk Pro Outdoor Basketball Hoop","text":"<p>The Dunk Pro Outdoor Basketball Hoop is designed for performance and convenience. Built with adjustable height, a durable galvanized steel pole, and a pro-level tempered glass backboard, this top-selling hoop is easy to install and provides exceptional stability. <\/p><p>Its breakaway rim and shock-absorbent design ensure safe, high-energy play for all ages and skill levels.<\/p>","button_label":"Buy Dunk Pro Outdoor Basketball Hoop","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dunk-pro-outdoor-basketball-hoop","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_jF3hVn":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Outdoor_Basketball_Flooring_Kits_3.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"BASKETBALL baseCOURT TILES","text":"<p>Our sport tiles are designed to exceed expectations, offering full customization options regardless of budget or space constraints. With our low-maintenance, all-weather performance flooring, you can spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying the game.<\/p>","button_label":"Buy Basketball surface tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/outdoor-baskeball-basecourt-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_WirYKJ":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Outdoor_Edging_47524559-3ea1-471e-9251-5d9cb48861fa.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Multi-Sports Surface Tiles","text":"<p>Engineered for versatility, our multi-sport flooring features multiple markings, such as hockey, basketball, volleyball, and more. With the flexibility to switch between sports effortlessly, there's no need for separate courts or surfaces. Whether you're organizing a basketball tournament, a hockey match, or a volleyball game, our multi-sport tiles offer the ideal foundation for a smooth and enjoyable sporting experience.<\/p>","button_label":"Buy Multi-Sports Surface Tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/multi-sports-surface-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_Kabqdy":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/3_7775039d-4f1c-4aa8-8c47-4ecb4033229e.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"roller hockey sports tiles","text":"<p>Roller hockey is a great alternative for those without access to an ice-rink. Our modular flooring is durable and ensures smooth skate-ability for intense matches. Choose out outdoor sports tiles for inline, roller and field hockey.<\/p><p><\/p>","button_label":"buy hockey surface tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/outdoor-roller-hockey-sports-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"37874044-cd52-45a8-a380-bfb7b865d836":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/VolleyballLifestyleImage1.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Volleyball Sports Tiles","text":"<p>Discover our high-quality shock absorption court surfaces for a safer game. Make your volleyball experience secure and fun with our reliable surfaces.<\/p>","button_label":"buy volleyball surface tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/outdoor-volleyball-sports-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"text_and_image_LmyyEr":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/5_51f01059-de74-4cb6-8baa-03f191f91f11.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"badminton court tiles","text":"<p>Our Outdoor Badminton Court Tiles deliver top-notch performance, durability, and reliability for players at any skill level. With a shock-absorbent surface that is 10-15% softer than hard concrete, they enhance comfort and reduce strain during play.<br\/><\/p>","button_label":"buy badminton surface tiles","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/outdoor-badminton-court-tiles","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"fe337351-30e1-4325-b2b3-7c9800f68687":{"type":"advanced-content","blocks":{"template--14491775762561__fe337351-30e1-4325-b2b3-7c9800f68687-1686686607366e9d76-0":{"type":"image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Cross-Linked_PE_Foam_2_1.gif","link":"","width":"50%","alignment":"center"}},"template--14491775762561__fe337351-30e1-4325-b2b3-7c9800f68687-1686686607366e9d76-1":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2>1-3\/8” CROSS LINK FOAM MATS<\/h2><p>Lightweight and portable with a shock-absorbent foam inner and durable vinyl surface, these mats are designed for martial arts and other athletic applications with intermediate to advanced users. <BR><BR><BR><i>Starting at <b>$8.26\/Sq ft.<\/b><\/i><\/p>\n\n<a href='https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/tumbling-super-mats'><button><b>SHOP HERE<\/b><\/a>","width":"25%","alignment":"center"}},"cabbe171-8918-40d2-bad5-a72f83eeac21":{"type":"liquid","settings":{"code":"<h2>2” CROSS LINK FOAM MATS<\/h2><p>Lightweight and portable with superior shock-absorbing capabilities, these mats are designed to withstand the toughest competitions and can easily handle grappling, throws, sweeps, and falls. <BR><BR>\n\n<i>Starting at <b>$11.36\/Sq.ft.<\/p><\/i><\/b>\n\n<a href='https:\/\/canadamats.ca\/products\/tumbling-super-mats'><button><b>SHOP HERE<\/b><\/a>","width":"25%","alignment":"center"}}},"block_order":["template--14491775762561__fe337351-30e1-4325-b2b3-7c9800f68687-1686686607366e9d76-0","template--14491775762561__fe337351-30e1-4325-b2b3-7c9800f68687-1686686607366e9d76-1","cabbe171-8918-40d2-bad5-a72f83eeac21"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"full_width":false,"space_around":true}},"text_columns_DWwxM9":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_x6ngHb":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/FitnessmatsLifestyleImages3.png","image_width":620,"title":"Fitnessmats 4.0","text":"<p>Support your workout with ergonomic comfort and joint relief. This mat is lightweight, durable, and easy to clean. Perfect for everyday training, stretching, or recovery.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Fitness Mat 4.0","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/fitness-mats-wellnessmats-4-0"}},"text_block_8mNCmK":{"type":"text_block","disabled":true,"settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/YogaMatsLifestyle1.png","image_width":650,"title":"MOREMAT Yoga Mats","text":"<p>Experience a joint-cushioning yoga mat that supports every pose. The MOREMAT delivers comfort, grip, and stability—perfect for yoga, stretching, or meditation.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Yoga Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/yoga-mats-fitness-wellnessmats"}},"text_block_daQn6z":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/FitnessmatsLifestyleImages6.png","image_width":650,"title":"Fitnessmats 5.5","text":"<p>Extra coverage and built-in grommets for easy storage. This mat cushions joints, resists microbes, and holds up to daily use in busy studios or clinics.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Fitness Mats 5.5","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/fitness-mats-wellnessmats-5-5"}}},"block_order":["text_block_x6ngHb","text_block_8mNCmK","text_block_daQn6z"],"name":"t:sections.text-columns.presets.text_columns_with_images.name","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"text_columns_BedJHh":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"text_block_wdaNnb":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/PilatesmatsLF1.png","image_width":650,"title":"Pilates Mats","text":"<p>Stay grounded with a non-slip, joint-cushioning surface built for Pilates. This mat delivers studio-grade support.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Pilates Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/pilates-mats-fitness-wellnessmats"}},"text_block_MfkUfm":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Foldingmats72_x30_x5_8_LF1_4.png","image_width":650,"title":"Folding Mats","text":"<p>Compact, comfortable, and ready to go. The Folding Mat features a foldable design, ideal for portable programs, classrooms, and space-saving setups.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Folding Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/folding-mats-fitness-wellnessmats"}},"text_block_ga4tRa":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Recovery_Mats_LF3.png","image_width":650,"title":"Recovery Mats","text":"<p>Engineered for cooldowns and recovery, Recovery Mats offer premium support, antimicrobial protection, and custom-fit options to create dedicated recovery zones.<\/p>","button_label":"Shop Recovery Mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/recovery-mats-fitness-wellnessmats"}}},"block_order":["text_block_wdaNnb","text_block_MfkUfm","text_block_ga4tRa"],"name":"t:sections.text-columns.presets.text_columns_with_images.name","settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"text_and_image_WMTXeF":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Mobile_Mats_Lifestyle_3.png","image_width":550,"subtitle":"All in One Convenient Bundle","title":"3 Premium Mobile Mats + Docking Station","text":"<p>Get joint-cushioning comfort and easy storage in one smart set. Perfect for group fitness or mobile wellness setups, this bundle keeps your space clean, organized, and ready to go.<\/p>","button_label":"get your bundle","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/mobile-mats-with-docking-station-fitness-wellnessmats","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"text_and_image_CrFYmH":{"type":"text-and-image","name":"t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Smart_Steps.png","image_width":550,"sub